<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Vite</strong> is a modern, fast build tool that pro=
vides a superior development experience compared to traditional bundlers. I=
t offers instant server start, lightning-fast Hot Module Replacement (HMR),=
 and optimized builds.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">It replaces older tools like Create React App by providing =
a leaner, faster build process</p>
