<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Differences from Create React App:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Faster startup</strong> - Vite uses native ES modules and doesn=
't bundle during development</li>
<li><strong>Instant HMR</strong> - Updates reflect immediately without full=
 page reload</li>
<li><strong>Optimized builds</strong> - Uses Rollup for production builds</=
li>
<li><strong>Smaller bundle sizes</strong> - Better tree-shaking and code sp=
litting</li>
<li><strong>Modern by default</strong> - No legacy browser support overhead=
</li>
</ul>
