<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Offline Support</strong> - Works without internet connection</l=
i>
<li><strong>Installable</strong> - Can be installed on home screen</li>
<li><strong>Fast</strong> - Instant reloads via caching</li>
<li><strong>Responsive</strong> - Works on any device size</li>
<li><strong>Secure</strong> - Served over HTTPS</li>
</ul>
