<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to Use Webpack:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Working with legacy codebases</li>
<li>Need specific advanced configurations</li>
<li>Require specific plugins not available in Vite</li>
<li>Complex multi-page applications with custom requirements</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to Use Vite:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Starting new React projects</li>
<li>Want faster development experience</li>
<li>Prefer minimal configuration</li>
<li>Building modern applications</li>
</ul>
