<p dir=3D"auto">Babel is a JavaScript compiler that converts modern JavaScr=
ipt (including JSX) into backwards-compatible JavaScript that browsers can =
understand. JSX is not valid JavaScript on its own =E2=80=94 Babel transfor=
ms it into <code>React.createElement()</code> calls at build time.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Step-by-step transpilation:</strong></p>
