g> and <strong>Named</strong> exports</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Default Export and Import (Recommended):</strong=
></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Use a default export when a file exports only one primary c=
omponent.</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Export</strong>: You use the export default keywords before the=
 component.</li>
<li><strong>Import</strong>: You import it without curly braces and can giv=
e it any name you prefer</li>
</ul>
