<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Syntax</td>
<td>JavaScript function</td>
<td>ES6 class extending <code>React.Component</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>State</td>
<td><code>useState()</code> hook</td>
<td><code>this.state</code> + <code>this.setState()</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Lifecycle</td>
<td><code>useEffect()</code> hook</td>
<td><code>componentDidMount()</code>, <code>componentDidUpdate()</code>, et=
