<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Class components</strong> are stateful/container co=
mponents that are regular ES6 classes extending <code>React.Component</code=
>. They're called stateful components because they:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Control how state changes and implement component logic</li>
<li>Have access to all React lifecycle methods</li>
<li>Must have a <code>render()</code> method that returns JSX</li>
</ul>
