<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Legacy Codebases</strong>: Maintaining existing projects built =
before 2019.</li>
<li><strong>Error Boundaries</strong>: Implementing components that catch J=
avaScript errors in their child tree, as these still require class-based li=
fecycle methods.</li>
<li><strong>Specific Third-Party Libraries</strong>: Interacting with older=
 libraries that may require a class-based structure.</li>
</ul>
