<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h2 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Q. Why props in React are read only?</h2><a id=
=3D"user-content-q-why-props-in-react-are-read-only" class=3D"anchor" aria-=
label=3D"Permalink: Q. Why props in React are read only?" href=3D"https://g=
