<p dir=3D"auto">We should not call <code>setState()</code> in <code>compone=
ntWillUnmount()</code> because the component will never be re-rendered. Onc=
e a component instance is unmounted, it will never be mounted again.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>componentWillUnmount()</code> is invoked immediat=
ely before a component is unmounted and destroyed. This method can be used =
to perform any necessary cleanup method, such as invalidating timers, cance=
ling network requests, or cleaning up any subscriptions that were created i=
n <code>componentDidMount()</code>.</p>
