<p dir=3D"auto">React also allows us to create custom Hooks with unique fea=
tures that extracts component logic into reusable functions.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">A custom Hooks has following features:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>As a function, it takes input and returns output.</li>
<li>Its name starts with <strong>use</strong> like useQuery, useMedia=E2=80=
=A6</li>
<li>Unlike functional components, custom hooks return a normal, non-jsx dat=
a.</li>
<li>Unlike normal functions, custom hooks can use other hooks such as useSt=
ate, useRef=E2=80=A6 and other custom hooks.</li>
</ul>
