<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>useState()</strong> or <strong>useReducer()</st=
rong> hooks can be used to force a React component to rerender.</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>The <code>useState()</code> hook returns an array with two elements, a =
value and an updater function.</li>
<li>Here, we are instantly calling the updater function, which in this case=
 is called with <code>undefined</code>, so it is the same as calling <code>=
updater(undefined)</code>.</li>
</ul>
