<p dir=3D"auto">We use array destructuring because <code>useState</code> re=
turns a pair (an array with exactly two items), and destructuring is the cl=
eanest way to give those items custom names in a single line.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>useState</code> hook allows us to make our functi=
on components stateful. When called, <code>useState()</code> returns an arr=
ay of two items. The first being our state value and the second being a fun=
ction for setting or updating that value.</p>
