<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>reducer</strong>: A function that takes the current state and a=
n action as arguments and returns the next state.</li>
<li><strong>initialState</strong>: The value the state starts with.</li>
<li><strong>dispatch</strong>: A function you call to trigger a state updat=
e by passing it an "action" (usually an object like { type: 'increment' }).=
</li>
</ul>
