<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Points:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>The component calling <code>useContext()</code> <strong>always re-rende=
rs</strong> when the context value changes.</li>
<li><code>useContext()</code> replaces the need for <code>Context.Consumer<=
/code> wrapper or <code>static contextType</code> in class components.</li>
<li>For performance, consider memoizing the context value with <code>useMem=
o</code> to avoid unnecessary re-renders.</li>
<li>Pass the context object itself (from <code>createContext</code>), <stro=
ng>not</strong> the Provider or Consumer.</li>
</ul>
