<p dir=3D"auto"><code>useTransition()</code> is a React Hook (introduced in=
 React 18) that lets you mark a state update as <strong>non-urgent</strong>=
, keeping the UI responsive during expensive re-renders. React will process=
 urgent updates (like typing) first, then apply the transition update when =
the browser is idle.</p>
