<p dir=3D"auto">To trigger a click event programmatically in React, you typ=
ically use a <strong>ref</strong> to access the underlying DOM element and =
then call its native <code>.click()</code> method</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative o=
verflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-k">import</span> <span cl=
