<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>How it works:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Attach a <strong>ref</strong> to the component root.</li>
<li>Listen on document for <code>mousedown</code> or <code>touchstart</code=
>.</li>
<li>If <code>event.target</code> is not inside <code>ref.current</code>, tr=
eat it as an outside click.</li>
<li>Remove listeners in cleanup to avoid leaks.</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><em>Use <code>mousedown</code> instead of <code>click</code=
> if you want the outside action to happen earlier (before focus/click side=
 effects inside other elements).</em></p>
