<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>What makes a good key:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Good</th>
<th>Bad</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Stable unique ID from data (<code>user.id</code>)</td>
<td>Array index when list can reorder</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>UUID or database primary key</td>
<td><code>Math.random()</code> (new key every render)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Slug or unique string identifier</td>
<td>Index when items can be inserted/deleted</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key rules:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Keys must be <strong>unique among siblings</strong>, not globally.</li>
<li>Keys are <strong>not passed as props</strong> =E2=80=94 the child canno=
t read <code>props.key</code>.</li>
<li>Keys must be <strong>stable</strong> across renders; changing them forc=
es a remount.</li>
</ul>
