<p dir=3D"auto">Rendering thousands of DOM nodes at once causes slow initia=
l paint, sluggish scrolling, and high memory usage. The core strategies are=
 <strong>virtualization</strong>, <strong>pagination</strong>, <strong>infi=
nite scrolling</strong>, and <strong>memoization</strong>.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Virtualization (windowing) =E2=80=94 most impact=
ful:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Only render the rows currently visible in the viewport. As =
the user scrolls, off-screen rows are unmounted and new ones are mounted. L=
ibraries like <code>react-window</code> and <code>react-virtual</code> impl=
ement this efficiently.</p>
