<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Points:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Use <code>e.target.files[0]</code> to access the selected file from the=
 input event.</li>
<li>Use <code>FormData</code> to send binary data to the server =E2=80=94 d=
o <strong>not</strong> manually set <code>Content-Type</code>; the browser =
sets the correct <code>multipart/form-data</code> boundary automatically.</=
li>
<li>Use <code>URL.createObjectURL()</code> for client-side image previews, =
and call <code>URL.revokeObjectURL()</code> on cleanup to avoid memory leak=
s.</li>
