<td>Minimum value (for numbers/dates)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>max</code></td>
<td><code>number | object</code></td>
<td>Maximum value</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>minLength</code></td>
<td><code>number | object</code></td>
<td>Minimum string length</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>maxLength</code></td>
<td><code>number | object</code></td>
<td>Maximum string length</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>pattern</code></td>
<td><code>RegExp | object</code></td>
<td>Regex pattern validation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>validate</code></td>
<td><code>Function | object</code></td>
<td>Custom validation function(s)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
