<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;Link&gt;</code> component is used to navigate=
 the different routes on the site. But <code>&lt;NavLink&gt;</code> is used=
 to add the style attributes to the active routes.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Link:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Renders an anchor tag that navigates without a full page re=
load. No awareness of whether the route is currently active.</p>
