<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>useNavigate()</strong> hook has been added to R=
eact Router v7 to replace the <code>useHistory()</code> hook.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Difference:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>v5 (useHistory)</th>
<th>v7 (useNavigate)</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>history.push('/path')</code></td>
<td><code>navigate('/path')</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>history.replace('/path')</code></td>
<td><code>navigate('/path', { replace: true })</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>history.goBack()</code></td>
<td><code>navigate(-1)</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>history.goForward()</code></td>
<td><code>navigate(1)</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
