<p dir=3D"auto"><code>React.lazy()</code> wraps a dynamic <code>import()</c=
ode> call. The import returns a Promise that resolves to a module with a de=
fault export of a React component. The lazy component must be rendered insi=
de <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> to show a fallback while loading.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative o=
