<p dir=3D"auto">If you want to do code-splitting in a server rendered app, =
it is recommend to use Loadable Components because <code>React.lazy</code> =
and <code>Suspense</code> is not available for server-side rendering (SSR).=
 Loadable lets you render a dynamic import as a regular component.</p>
