<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Features</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Automatic Chunk Naming:</strong> It generates meaningful names =
for your code chunks automatically, which is helpful for debugging.</li>
<li><strong>Error Handling:</strong> It works seamlessly with React Error B=
oundaries to handle network failures or loading errors gracefully.</li>
<li><strong>Developer Experience:</strong> The API is designed to be simple=
, allowing you to wrap an import in a <code>loadable()</code> function and =
use it like a regular component.</li>
</ul>
