<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key Concepts:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong><code>&lt;Outlet /&gt;</code></strong> =E2=80=94 placeholder in=
 the parent layout where the active child route renders.</li>
<li><strong><code>index</code> route</strong> =E2=80=94 the default child r=
endered when the parent path is matched exactly (<code>/dashboard</code>).<=
/li>
<li><strong>Relative paths</strong> =E2=80=94 child <code>path</code> value=
s are relative to the parent; no leading <code>/</code> needed.</li>
<li><strong>Multiple nesting levels</strong> =E2=80=94 routes can be nested=
 as deeply as required.</li>
</ul>
