<p dir=3D"auto">In React, <strong>inheritance</strong> is a concept where o=
ne component inherits properties or behaviors from another, typically using=
 the <code>extends</code> keyword in Class Components. However, it is consi=
dered an <strong>anti-pattern</strong> and is officially discouraged by the=
 React team. The React team recommends <strong>Composition</strong> over In=
heritance.</p>
