<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Pure Components</strong> in React are the component=
s which do not re-renders when the value of state and props has been update=
d with the same values. Pure Components restricts the re-rendering ensuring=
 the higher performance of the Component.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Features of React Pure Components:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Prevents re-rendering of Component if props or state is the same</li>
<li>Takes care of <code>shouldComponentUpdate()</code> implicitly</li>
<li><code>State()</code> and <code>Props</code> are Shallow Compared</li>
<li>Pure Components are more performant in certain cases</li>
</ul>
