<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>A HOC does not modify or mutate components. It creates a new one.</li>
<li>A HOC is used to compose components for code reuse.</li>
<li>A HOC is a pure function. It has no side effects, returning only a new =
component.</li>
</ul>
