<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>Refs</strong> (short for "references") provide =
a way to access DOM without triggering a component re-render. React <code>R=
efs</code> are a useful feature that act as a means to reference a DOM elem=
ent or a class component from within a parent component.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Refs also provide some flexibility for referencing elements=
 within a child component from a parent component, in the form of <strong>r=
ef forwarding</strong>.</p>
