<p dir=3D"auto">Ref forwarding is a technique for passing a <code>ref</code=
> through a component to one of its children. It is very useful for cases l=
ike reusable component libraries and Higher Order Components (HOC).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">We can forward a <code>ref</code> to a component by using t=
he <code>React.forwardRef()</code> function. Ref forwarding allows componen=
ts to take a ref they receive and pass it further down (in other words, "fo=
rward" it) to a child.</p>
