lt;Button&gt;</code>) that need to expose DOM nodes</li>
<li>Higher Order Components (HOCs) that wrap components but must pass refs =
through</li>
<li>Integrating with third-party libraries that require a direct DOM refere=
nce.</li>
</ul>
