<li>A static method called <strong>getDerivedStateFromError()</strong>, whi=
ch is used to update the error boundary's state</li>
<li>A <strong>componentDidCatch()</strong> lifecycle method for performing =
operations when our error boundaries catch an error, such as logging to an =
error logging service</li>
<li>A <strong>render()</strong> method for rendering our error boundary's c=
hild or the fallback UI in case of an error</li>
</ul>
