<p dir=3D"auto">React Elements are immutable =E2=80=94 once created, you ca=
nnot update their children or attributes directly. To update a rendered ele=
ment, you must re-render with a new element.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Using <code>useState</code> + <code>useEffect</code=
> (Recommended approach):</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">In practice, managing periodic updates via <code>setInterva=
l</code> inside a component using hooks is the idiomatic React way. State c=
hanges trigger re-renders automatically.</p>
