<p dir=3D"auto"><code>Flow</code> is a static analysis tool which uses a su=
perset of the language, allows to add type annotations to all of your code =
and catch an entire class of bugs at compile time.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><code>PropTypes</code> is a basic type checker which has be=
en patched onto React. It can not check anything other than the types of th=
e props being passed to a given component.</p>
