<p dir=3D"auto">React 19 (released in 2024) introduced several major featur=
es focused on simplifying async data handling, form management, and reducin=
g the need for manual memoization.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Actions =E2=80=94 async state management made ea=
sy</strong></p>
