<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>React 19 feature summary:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Feature</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>useActionState</code></td>
<td>Manages async form action state</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>useFormStatus</code></td>
<td>Reads pending/data state of parent form</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>useOptimistic</code></td>
<td>Optimistic UI during async operations</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>use()</code></td>
<td>Read Promises and Context; callable conditionally</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Server Actions</td>
<td><code>'use server'</code> functions callable from client</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>ref</code> as prop</td>
<td>No more <code>forwardRef()</code> needed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;Context&gt;</code> as provider</td>
<td>Use <code>&lt;MyContext value=3D{...}&gt;</code> instead of <code>&lt;M=
yContext.Provider&gt;</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
