<div class=3D"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overf=
low-auto"><pre class=3D"notranslate"><code>User performs action (e.g., subm=
its form)
         =E2=86=93
App is offline =E2=86=92 Store request in IndexedDB
         =E2=86=93
Register a sync event with the Service Worker
         =E2=86=93
Device reconnects to internet
         =E2=86=93
Service Worker fires 'sync' event
         =E2=86=93
Service Worker replays the stored request
         =E2=86=93
User's data is successfully sent to the server
