<li>Focuses on the component tree and its internal structure.</li>
<li>Uses <code>.shallow()</code> (shallow rendering), <code>.mount()</code>=
 (full DOM), or <code>.render()</code> (static HTML).</li>
<li>Encourages testing <em>how</em> a component works internally.</li>
</ul>
