<li>Built on top of <code>@testing-library/dom</code>; uses queries like <c=
ode>getByText</code>, <code>getByRole</code>, <code>getByLabelText</code>.<=
/li>
<li>Encourages testing <em>what the user sees and does</em>.</li>
</ul>
