</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>eslint-plugin-react-hooks</strong></td>
<td>Enforces Rules of Hooks</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Prettier</strong></td>
<td>Consistent code formatting</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>TypeScript</strong></td>
<td>Static type checking</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Husky + lint-staged</strong></td>
<td>Pre-commit hooks to run linters/tests</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>SonarQube / SonarCloud</strong></td>
<td>Continuous code quality and security scanning</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Codecov / Coveralls</strong></td>
<td>Coverage tracking and PR gate checks</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
