<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Always move focus to newly opened dialogs, drawers, and menus.</li>
<li>Return focus to the trigger element after closing a dialog.</li>
<li>Use <code>tabIndex=3D{-1}</code> to make non-interactive elements focus=
able programmatically.</li>
<li>Never remove the visible focus outline without providing a clear altern=
ative.</li>
</ul>
