<p dir=3D"auto">React applications can implement several authentication str=
ategies depending on security requirements and backend architecture.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Cookie-Based Authentication (Session Auth)</stro=
ng></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The server creates a session and sets a <code>Set-Cookie</c=
ode> header. The browser stores the cookie and sends it automatically with =
every subsequent request.</p>
