<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>3. OAuth 2.0 / Social Login</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Users authenticate via a third-party provider (Google, GitH=
ub, Microsoft) and the app receives an access token or authorization code.<=
/p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>The user is redirected to the provider's login page.</li>
<li>After consent, the provider redirects back with a code.</li>
<li>The server exchanges the code for an access token.</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto">Popular libraries: <code>@react-oauth/google</code>, <code>=
react-github-login</code>, <code>next-auth</code>.</p>
